icture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ruptured_(Condition)\" title=\"Ruptured (Condition)\">Ruptured</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Ruptured\"> Condition: Ruptured </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ruptured_(Condition)\" title=\"Ruptured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ruptured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ruptured_(Condition)\" title=\"Ruptured (Condition)\">Ruptured</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 5  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DEX Save (DC&nbsp;12)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;12)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Take <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> for each 1 m (3 ft) movement. Each time the damage is triggered, reduce the condition duration by 1.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Timothy\" title=\"Timothy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png/25px-Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png/38px-Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png/50px-Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Timothy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png/25px-Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Portrait_%27Timothy%27.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Timothy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Timothy\">Timothy</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tomelia\" title=\"Tomelia\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png/25px-Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png/38px-Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png/50px-Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tomelia\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png/25px-Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Portrait_%27Tomelia%27.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tomelia\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tomelia\">Tomelia</a> on