5px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ruptured_(Condition)\" title=\"Ruptured (Condition)\">Ruptured</a> condition is required by the target even if this arrow misses.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715052313\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.087 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3357/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 42776/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9842/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1215073/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   69.070      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   69.070      1 -total\n 43.95%   30.358     14 Template:Icon_text\n 37.48%   25.887     33 Template:Trim\n 18.21%   12.581      7 Template:Icon_link\n 14.80%   10.222      1 Template:Condition\n 13.74%    9.490      2 Template:Uid\n 13.27%    9.164      2 Template:Cond\n 10.10%    6.973     14 Template:Ifempty\n  9.70%    6.701      3 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:14015-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715052313 and revision id 386610. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}